{"id":"portswigger-web-security-academy--information-disclosure--common-sources-of-information-disclosure--information-disclosure-on-debug-page","path":"portswigger-web-security-academy/information-disclosure/common-sources-of-information-disclosure/information-disclosure-on-debug-page.md","title":"Information disclosure on debug page","category":"portswigger-web-security-academy","source":"https://github.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/blob/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/portswigger-web-security-academy/information-disclosure/common-sources-of-information-disclosure/information-disclosure-on-debug-page.md","html":"<h1 id=\"information-disclosure-on-debug-page\">Information disclosure on debug page</h1>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>This lab contains a debug page that discloses sensitive information about the application. To solve the lab, obtain and submit the <code>SECRET_KEY</code> environment variable.</p>\n<h2 id=\"solution\">Solution</h2>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand Information disclosure on debug page screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(18)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"Information disclosure on debug page screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>Searching into page source (CTRL+U) the world 'debug' we found this info disclosure into comments, with a link for this config website: /cgi-bin/phpinfo.php</p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand Information disclosure on debug page screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(19)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"Information disclosure on debug page screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>Adding it to the orginal URL (<a href=\"https://0a5400be03dcbfb683c47334006b00dd.web-security-academy.net/cgi-bin/phpinfo.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://0a5400be03dcbfb683c47334006b00dd.web-security-academy.net/cgi-bin/phpinfo.php</a>) we can obtain info about php version and all other configration data (in our case the 'SECRET_KEY')</p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand Information disclosure on debug page screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(20)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"Information disclosure on debug page screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand Information disclosure on debug page screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(21)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"Information disclosure on debug page screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n","toc":[{"id":"description","title":"Description","level":2},{"id":"solution","title":"Solution","level":2}],"excerpt":"Information disclosure on debug page Description This lab contains a debug page that discloses sensitive information about the application. To solve the lab, obtain and submit the SECRET_KEY environment variable. Solutio","searchText":"Description Solution"}